    Process the input text according to the following rules:
    - If it contains any whitespace characters, split on whitespace and return the list of words.
    - Otherwise, if it contains a comma, split on commas and return the list of segments.
    - Otherwise, count lowercase letters whose alphabet index is odd (a=1, b=2, etc.) and return that count.
